<CapabilityStatement xmlns="http://hl7.org/fhir">
  <id value="hsa-regional-catalog-server"/>
  <text>
    <status value="extensions"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p class="res-header-id"><b>Genererad berättande text: CapabilityStatement hsa-regional-catalog-server</b></p><a name="hsa-regional-catalog-server"> </a><a name="hchsa-regional-catalog-server"> </a><h2 id="title">HSA Regional Catalog Server (hypotes)</h2><ul><li>Implementationsguidens version: 0.1.0 </li><li>FHIR-version: 5.0.0 </li><li>Format som stöds: <code>json</code>, <code>xml</code></li><li>Publicerad: 2026-05-21 </li><li>Publicerad av: Inera AB / HSA-IG projekt </li></ul><blockquote class="impl-note"><p><strong>Notera till implementörer: FHIR-förmågor</strong></p><p>Vilken FHIR-förmåga som helst kan vara 'tillåten' av systemet om den inte uttryckligen är markerad som 'SHALL NOT'. Några objekt är markerade som MAY i implementationsguiden för att belysa deras potentiella relevans för användningsfallet.</p></blockquote><h2 id="rest">FHIR RESTful-förmågor</h2><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 id="mode1" class="panel-title">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class="panel-body"><div><p>En möjlig utformning kombinerar läs-API:et från det centrala exemplet med
skrivoperationer för att möjliggöra datainläsning från LDAP eller andra källor.
Transaktionsbuntar kan användas för bulkuppdatering och conditional update
(PUT by identifier) kan möjliggöra idempotent LDAP→FHIR-synkronisering.
Hur detta faktiskt ska fungera i regionala system är en öppen fråga.</p>
</div><div class="lead"><em>Sammanfattning av systemövergripande interaktioner</em></div><ul><li>Stöder <code>transaction</code>interaktion beskrivs enligt följande:<div><p>Transaction-buntar kan möjliggöra atomär bulkuppdatering vid LDAP-synkronisering.</p>
</div></li><li>Stöder <code>batch</code>interaktion beskrivs enligt följande:<div><p>Stöd för batchbuntar för icke-atomär bulkläsning/-skrivning.</p>
</div></li></ul></div></div><h3 id="resourcesCap1">Förmågor per resurs/profil</h3><h4 id="resourcesSummary1">Sammanfattning</h4><p>Sammanfattningstabellen listar resurserna som ingår i denna konfiguration, och för varje resurs listar den:</p><ul><li>De relevanta profilerna (om några)</li><li>Interaktionerna som stöds av varje resurs (<b><span class="bg-info">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class="bg-info">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class="bg-info">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class="bg-info">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class="bg-info">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class="bg-info">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class="bg-info">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class="bg-info">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class="bg-info">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class="bg-info">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class="bg-info">T</span></b>yp är endast närvarande om minst en av resurserna har stöd för dem.</li><li><span>De obligatoriska, rekommenderade och vissa valfria sökparametrarna (om några). </span></li><li>De länkade resurserna aktiverade för <code>_include</code></li><li>De övriga resurserna aktiverade för <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>Operationerna på resursen (om några)</li></ul><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th><b>Resurstyp</b></th><th><b>Profil</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="GET en resurs (läs-interaktion)">R</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="GET alla resurser av typen (sök-interaktion)">S</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="PUT en ny resursversion (uppdatera-interaktion)">U</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="POST en ny resurs (skapa-interaktion)">C</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="DELETE en resurs (radera-interaktion)">D</b></th><th><b title="Obligatoriska och rekommenderade sökparametrar">Sökningar</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operationer</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#Organization1-1">Organization</a></td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-catalog-organization.html">https://hsa.inera.se/fhir/StructureDefinition/hsa-catalog-organization</a><br/><em>Ytterligare stödda profiler:</em><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-healthcare-provider-organization.html">HSA Healthcare Provider Organization</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-healthcare-unit-organization.html">HSA Healthcare Unit Organization</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td>_id, _security, _lastUpdated, identifier, active, name, type, partof, hsa-id, hsa-org-class</td><td><code>Organization:partof</code></td><td><code>Organization:partof</code>, <code>Location:organization</code>, <code>HealthcareService:organization</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href="#Location1-2">Location</a></td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-catalog-location.html">https://hsa.inera.se/fhir/StructureDefinition/hsa-catalog-location</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td>_id, _security, _lastUpdated, identifier, status, organization, near, hsa-id</td><td><code>Location:organization</code></td><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href="#HealthcareService1-3">HealthcareService</a></td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-healthcare-service.html">https://hsa.inera.se/fhir/StructureDefinition/hsa-healthcare-service</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td>_id, _security, _lastUpdated, active, organization, location, service-category, service-type, hsa-provided-by</td><td><code>HealthcareService:organization</code>, <code>HealthcareService:location</code></td><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="Organization1-1" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>Organization</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Bassystemprofil</span><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-catalog-organization.html">HSA Catalog Organization</a></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Profilkonformans</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Referenspolicy</span><br/><code>resolves</code></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-6"><span class="lead">Profiler som stöds</span><p><a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-healthcare-provider-organization.html">HSA Healthcare Provider Organization</a><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-healthcare-unit-organization.html">HSA Healthcare Unit Organization</a></p></div><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li>Stöder <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>update</code>, <code>delete</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><span class="lead">Dokumentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Organisationer – samma läs-API som centralt system plus skrivoperationer för LDAP-synk.</p>
</div></blockquote></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="lead">Sökparametrar</span><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Konformans</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Typ</th><th>Dokumentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_id</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_security</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Filtrering på destinationIndicator (meta.security).</p>
</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_lastUpdated</td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div><p>Inkrementell synk: hämta resurser ändrade efter en given tidpunkt.</p>
</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>identifier</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>active</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>name</td><td><code>string</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>type</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>partof</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href="SearchParameter-hsa-id.html">hsa-id</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href="SearchParameter-hsa-org-class.html">hsa-org-class</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="col-lg-5"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="Location1-2" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>Location</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Bassystemprofil</span><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-catalog-location.html">HSA Catalog Location</a></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Profilkonformans</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li>Stöder <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>update</code>, <code>delete</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><span class="lead">Dokumentation</span><blockquote><div><p>Besöksplatser – samma läs-API som centralt system plus skrivoperationer.</p>
</div></blockquote></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="lead">Sökparametrar</span><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Konformans</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Typ</th><th>Dokumentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_id</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_security</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_lastUpdated</td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>identifier</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>status</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>organization</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>near</td><td><code>special</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href="SearchParameter-hsa-id.html">hsa-id</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="col-lg-5"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="HealthcareService1-3" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>HealthcareService</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Bassystemprofil</span><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-hsa-healthcare-service.html">HSA Healthcare Service</a></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Profilkonformans</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul><li>Stöder <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>update</code>, <code>delete</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><span class="lead">Dokumentation